{"id":"scha_del","lemma":"Schädel","pos":"noun","rank":1875,"glosses":["skull","head","headache, particularly one due to excessive drinking"],"ipa":"/ˈʃɛːdəl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/86/De-Sch%C3%A4del.ogg/De-Sch%C3%A4del.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schädels","plural":"Schädel"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist ein Schädel.","en":"That's a skull.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Mein Schädel bringt mich um!","en":"My head is killing me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757210","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to bring","l":"bringen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"around / at"}]},{"text":"Der menschliche Schädel besteht aus dreiundzwanzig Knochen.","en":"The human skull consists of 23 bones.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"human, manlike","l":"menschlich"},null,{"g":"to succeed, to pass","l":"bestehen"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"twenty-three"},{"g":"bone"}]},{"text":"Mir war, als zerspränge mir der Schädel.","en":"I thought my head was going to explode.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"at the same moment"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Hör auf, herumzuschreien! Mir schmerzt der Schädel!","en":"Stop yelling. My head hurts.","words":[{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"on"},null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to hurt, to ache","l":"schmerzen"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}